### Prerequisite: `netlify dev` running locally.
### Uses the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8888/.netlify/functions
@ghToken = paste-gh_token-cookie-value-here

### F-7: clears the gh_token cookie. Expect 200 { "success": true } and
### Set-Cookie: gh_token=; ...; Max-Age=0
POST {{baseUrl}}/github-auth-logout
Cookie: gh_token={{ghToken}}

### F-7: succeeds even with no gh_token cookie present.
POST {{baseUrl}}/github-auth-logout

### Wrong method is rejected — expect 405 { "error": "Method not allowed" }.
GET {{baseUrl}}/github-auth-logout
